# FlowFetch Next — Environment Variables

## Backend (`backend/.env`)

```env
# Server
PORT=3001
NODE_ENV=development

# Security
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5173
MAX_CONCURRENT_JOBS=3
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=60000
RATE_LIMIT_MAX=20

# Paths (optional overrides)
# YTDLP_PATH=yt-dlp          # binary name or absolute path
# FFMPEG_PATH=ffmpeg         # binary name or absolute path
# TMP_DIR=./tmp              # temp directory for merging

# Timeouts (ms)
ANALYZE_TIMEOUT_MS=30000
DOWNLOAD_TIMEOUT_MS=300000
```

## Frontend (`frontend/.env`)

```env
# Vite proxies /api to the backend; this is the backend base URL used in production
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3001
```

## Notes
- Never commit real values for secrets or credentials.
- yt-dlp cookies are NOT supported in this app — do not add cookie flags.
- See README.md for full setup instructions.
